    cases: <section className="case-ledger"><div className="structured-section-heading"><div className="eyebrow amber"><span></span> APPLICATION LEDGER</div><h2>Problem. Route.<br /><em>Next action.</em></h2><p>These pathways show how a buyer can frame a sourcing request without inventing customer claims or unsupported results.</p></div><div className="case-list">{data.cards.map(([heading, body], index) => <article key={heading}><div className="case-index">0{index + 1}</div><div className="case-content"><span>APPLICATION PATHWAY</span><h3>{heading}</h3><p>{body}</p><Link to="/quote">Discuss this pathway <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></Link></div><button type="button" className="case-arrow" onClick={openInquiry} aria-label={`Discuss ${heading}`}><ArrowUpRight size={24} /></button></article>)}</div></section>,
